{"slug":"b-e-d","ar":"ب ع د","total":235,"core":"distance; after","forms":[{"ar":"بَعْد","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":199,"gloss":"After","word":"bad","ex":{"s":26,"a":120,"p":3,"ar":["ثُمَّ","أَغْرَقْنَا","بَعْدُ","ٱلْبَاقِينَ"],"en":"Then We drowned thereafter the remaining ones"}},{"ar":"بَعِيد","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":25,"gloss":"far, distant","word":null,"ex":{"s":70,"a":6,"p":3,"ar":["إِنَّهُمْ","يَرَوْنَهُۥ","بَعِيدًا"],"en":"Indeed, they see it [as] distant"}},{"ar":"بُعْد","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":7,"gloss":"away with; distance","word":null,"ex":{"s":23,"a":41,"p":6,"ar":["فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ","ٱلصَّيْحَةُ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","فَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ","غُثَآءً ۚ","فَبُعْدًا","لِّلْقَوْمِ","ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ"],"en":"So the shriek seized them in truth, and We made them as [plant] stubble. Then away with the wrongdoing people"}},{"ar":"بَعُدَتْ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":2,"gloss":"to be distant; to perish","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":95,"p":9,"ar":["كَأَن","لَّمْ","يَغْنَوْا۟","فِيهَآ ۗ","أَلَا","بُعْدًا","لِّمَدْيَنَ","كَمَا","بَعِدَتْ","ثَمُودُ"],"en":"As if they had never prospered therein. Then, away with Madyan as Thamud was taken away"}},{"ar":"بَٰعِدْ","kind":"verb","form":3,"count":1,"gloss":"to lengthen the distance","word":null,"ex":{"s":34,"a":19,"p":3,"ar":["فَقَالُوا۟","رَبَّنَا","بَـٰعِدْ","بَيْنَ","أَسْفَارِنَا","وَظَلَمُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","فَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمْ","أَحَادِيثَ","وَمَزَّقْنَـٰهُمْ","كُلَّ","مُمَزَّقٍ ۚ","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ","لِّكُلِّ","صَبَّارٍ","شَكُورٍ"],"en":"But [insolently] they said, \"Our Lord, lengthen the distance between our journeys,\" and wronged themselves, so We made them narrations and dispersed them in total dispersion. Indeed in that are signs for everyone patient and grateful"}},{"ar":"مُبْعَدُون","kind":"passive participle","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"removed far","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":101,"p":9,"ar":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","سَبَقَتْ","لَهُم","مِّنَّا","ٱلْحُسْنَىٰٓ","أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","عَنْهَا","مُبْعَدُونَ"],"en":"Indeed, those for whom the best [reward] has preceded from Us - they are from it far removed"}}],"surahs":[[2,27],[3,18],[7,15],[4,13],[16,11],[5,9],[9,9],[11,9],[30,8],[24,7],[42,7],[10,6],[12,6],[6,5],[21,5],[23,5],[34,5],[14,4],[45,4],[22,3],[28,3],[35,3],[40,3],[41,3],[47,3],[50,3],[8,2],[13,2],[17,2],[25,2],[26,2],[27,2],[33,2],[38,2],[57,2],[65,2],[18,1],[19,1],[20,1],[29,1],[31,1],[36,1],[39,1],[43,1],[46,1],[48,1],[49,1],[53,1],[59,1],[61,1],[66,1],[68,1],[70,1],[77,1],[79,1],[95,1],[98,1]]}